# Development Practices

This project inherits [ABLE Workflow template]({% raw %}{{ able_workflow_copier_docs }}{% endraw %}/overview/best-practices/) best practices.They are meant to make the project easier to rerun, review, and extend, not to force every project into the same exact workflow.

- Keep workflow steps explicit and reproducible.
- Prefer reusable package code over one-off workflow scripts when logic needs to be shared.
- Validate data contracts instead of relying on implicit assumptions.
- Keep environments declared so other people can rerun the project without reconstructing dependencies manually.
- Keep tests, typing, linting, and docs aligned with code changes.
- Use CI and code review to catch regressions before they spread.
